ABOUT THIS REPOSITORY
---------------------
This repository contains the public documentation and showcase site for
IcZScripts.extension, a proprietary pyRevit suite for Autodesk Revit. It
documents capabilities and architecture only. The suite's implementation lives
in a separate private repository and is not distributed here.

