WHY THIS AND NOT AN OPEN-SOURCE LICENSE
---------------------------------------
A permissive license (MIT, Apache-2.0) is effectively irrevocable once
published: anyone may rely on the grant from that moment on. This repository
showcases proprietary software, so the reversible choice is to reserve rights
now and loosen them deliberately later, rather than the other way round. If a
permissive or Creative Commons license is wanted for the documentation text,
replacing this file is a one-line decision - the reverse is not.
